references.ref:
`.edit_doc/ai_history.jsonl` — the per-write provenance log;
format documented alongside the AI module ([SDD §10](#10),
[SDD §17](#17)).

module.responsibility:
Cache the parsed tree and the UI-hint registry per session;
invalidate on file watch, on `apply_edit`, and on schema
change.

interfaces.interface:
`lint() -> LintResult` — re-runs `lint_project.lint(tree)`;
results carry stable `code` strings used by the extension's
Quick Fix provider.

`merge_three_way(base_xml, ours_xml, theirs_xml) -> {
merged_xml, residual_conflicts: [Conflict], lint }` —
delegates to `project_merge.merge`.

module.responsibility:
Maintain a `DiagnosticCollection` for `doc/Project.xml`;
update on save, on `apply_edit` success, and on out-of-band
file change.

interfaces.interface:
`vscode.chat.createChatParticipant('projectspec', …)`;
streams the sidecar's response with clickable
`Project.xml` links generated from the locator.
